product_design_content='''<p>our Product Design team bridges creativity and engineering precision. We use advanced CAD/CAM software and 3D modeling tools to design plastic components that meet functional, aesthetic, and production requirements. Our engineers collaborate closely with clients to optimize each design for durability, material efficiency, and moldability. From concept sketches to final 3D prototypes, we ensure every product is ready for flawless manufacturing and real-world performance.</p>'''
rapid_content='''<p>Rapid Prototyping is often used to create a physical sample of a design concept. It can be used to calculate form, fit and function and to evaluate new and innovative ideas.</p>
<p>we specialize in producing of high-quality, low cost rapid prototypes. With a range of technologies at our disposal, we are the ideal one stop shop for all your prototyping requirements, and when you’re prepared we also provide volume manufacturing up to hundreds of thousands of units.</p>
<h2 class="detail-section-title">Benefits of Prototypes</h2><ul class="about-bullets"><li>Show your customers and investors a model of your product</li><li>Demonstrate the appearance, dimensions and features of your product</li><li>Test your design for its suitability</li><li>Save time and money by identifying and reducing design flaws</li><li>Improve and streamline the production process</li><li>Create multiple versions with different colors, surface textures, etc.</li></ul>'''
mould_design_content='''<p>With our wide ranging experience in tooling, we have the expertise and perspectives to design and deliver. Staying sharp and up to date with these fundamental skills allows us to invent higher innovative solutions, continuously reinventing how we do molds. Understanding the crux of the technical outlook permits us to approach our designs with endless creativity. Addtionaly, using automated programs allows us to test our designs before going into production, giving us added flexibility when designing and engineering molds.</p>'''
mould_manufacturing_content='''<p>With deep roots in mold tooling,  Mold &amp; Design, we have the expertise and perspectives to efficiently design, build and deliver high-performing, custom, mold manufacturing solutions for a variety of applications.</p>
<p>Single &amp; Multi cavity molds - From single cavity molds for lesser volumes to multi-cavity molds for high-volume parts, we are equipped and ready for any challenge. Based on a customer’s needs, we offer the greatest value with our mold manufacturing service, taking into consideration of lower upfront costs, minimal long-term maintenance and overall exceptional quality.</p>
<p>Bridge Tooling - It grants us to produce tools proficient of supporting small quantities while gaining market acceptance. It saves from premature spending on expensive tools or prototypes, gauging performance before making a huge investment. We offer this to our clients to simplify their supply chains while allowing them to commercialize their product instantly and affordably while securing market acceptance. Once they are ready to go ahead with the real thing, we haul out every rupee of cost and go full bore on tooling.</p>'''
mould_testing_content='''<p>Unlike others we carry the mould testing activity at our premises itself, we take pride in having armed with latest processors which are completely managed by high end injection moulding machines from across various global standard branded companies and perform the testing activity in full range of capacity.</p>
<p>Our well trained and experienced staff does the Mould qualification, they perform the process and qualify the moulds after many stages of careful and accurate exercises for outstanding results in production. We also practice a habit of delivering the qualified and validated moulds by our own staff so as to ensure that the commissioning of the mould is done perfectly for our clients.</p>'''
mass_production_content='''<p>Seamlessly integrating our in-house processes, we also work with outsource partners to maintain optimal quality and efficiency. Overseeing the entire process gives us the ability to manage the material selection and mold design, ensuring a successful run from start to finish. This allows us to speed things up and control schedules solely based on our own (and our clients’) sense of urgency and priorities.</p>
<h2 class="detail-section-title">Service highlighting points</h2><p>artechnocraft is consistently striving for excellence as a sustainable outsource. Through employing world-className viable manufacturing and environmentally friendly practices, we enhance the profitability of our customers – understanding that reducing energy – means producing higher economical plastic components and industrial solutions.</p>
<h2 class="detail-section-title">Quality highlighting points</h2><p>A commitment to meeting the long term needs of our customers by providing an environment of continuous improvement though which our customers and artechnocraft will prosper and share in long term profitability.</p>'''
